**ZERO verified public benchmark numbers — or any verified public facts at all — were found for this exact model/ID.** Per the self-exclusion rule this file is saved as `GLM_5.3.md.excluded` — no scored `.md` is written, and no placeholder scores are invented.

What was checked (2026-10-02):

- **Identity:** the only trace of "Fledge Alpha" is this repo's scaffolded stub `meta.json` (`opencode/fledge-alpha`, `scaffolded: true`, placeholder "128K / text in/out / standard pricing"). No vendor, publisher, or official model name could be established.
- **OpenCode Zen docs** (complete endpoints + pricing tables, fetched 2026-10-02): no `fledge-alpha` anywhere — not in the model list, not in pricing, not in the deprecated list. The `opencode/` ID namespace resolves to Zen IDs, so the stub's ID currently matches no live Zen model.
- **BenchLM** (`fledge-alpha`): 404; not in the 783-model directory.
