Even the stub's specs (128K context, text in/out) are scaffold placeholders — no verified source backs them. With no identity, no specs, and no benchmarks there is nothing an honest Overall score could be computed from. A future re-research should look for (a) a live `fledge-alpha` ID on Zen or any provider, (b) a vendor announcement, or (c) aggregator coverage — then write a fresh `GLM_5.3.md`.

Scores inside this file are intentionally omitted/ignored: the sync skips `.excluded` files loudly.

